Arrival at the Eggberge mountain railway after approx. 5 hours.
<HikeImage idx={29} />

## Departure

Take the mountain railway and bus from Eggberge to Altdorf. From there, take the train home.
<JourneyPlanner from="Eggberge" to="<current location>" fromFixed time="14:00" target="departure" />
